554,0.789,0.424,0.132,0.015,0.025,0.005,0.003,0.002,0.002,0.001,0.524,0.395,0.253,0.231,0.2,0.166,0.138,0.114,0.093,0.078,0.211,0.203,0.095,0.038,0.032,0.025,0.017,0.01,0.006,0.002],"paragraphs":[{"i":0,"text":"ADDITIONAL TIPS FOR PARENTS","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":4},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":4},"differ":false},{"i":1,"text":"Most @pet_type s enjoy sniffing around fire hydrants, picking up scents… and sometimes leaving one. Go to a local hydrant to find Squeaky’s trail to see if @pet_name was there. Let’s ask it together.","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":36},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":36},"differ":false},{"i":2,"text":"\"Hi! Have you seen Squeaky?\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":5},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":5},"differ":false},{"i":3,"text":"\"Oh, hello! Well aren’t you just the cutest thing! Yes, of course I remember your dear, sweet pet and its adorable squeaky toy. They were the highlight of my day!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":3.424,"end":15.62,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":30,"words":30},"large":{"start":1.7800000000000007,"end":14.78,"frac":1.0,"status":"ok","matched":30,"words":30},"differ":true},{"i":4,"text":"\"Such a marvelous pair they made, one holding the other in its mouth. Trotting and squeaking along in harmony. What a devastating turn of events! To lose such a trusty friend like that. It’s just… just… just heartbreaking! [Starts sobbing]","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":15.84,"end":33.248,"frac":0.925,"status":"ok","matched":37,"words":40},"large":{"start":15.84,"end":35.904,"frac":0.95,"status":"ok","matched":38,"words":40},"differ":true},{"i":5,"text":"\"Oh, no, oh no here come the waterworks! [Long, exaggerated sobbing] WHYYY?!!! They were such GOOD FRIENDS!!! [Sobs]","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":37.8,"end":50.112,"frac":0.722,"status":"ok","matched":13,"words":18},"large":{"start":36.48,"end":49.568,"frac":0.5,"status":"ok","matched":9,"words":18},"differ":true},{"i":6,"text":"\"Sorry, watch your feet there. Dear me, I’m flooding the streets with tears. [Sobs winding down] Oh, I’m in such a state. “Where’s the fire?” they’ll say. I better get a hold of my gushing or I’ll be out of water when it counts. [Sniff]","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":56.064,"end":73.088,"frac":0.911,"status":"ok","matched":41,"words":45},"large":{"start":56.064,"end":73.088,"frac":0.911,"status":"ok","matched":41,"words":45},"differ":false},{"i":7,"text":"\"Well, I don’t know where they were off to, but your pet drooled on me, just a little, before heading off. Like it saw something enticing. Something two best buds… [quivering] couldn’t wait to share… on a perfect day together… [Sobs again] Good luck on your search!\"","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":76.064,"end":102.42,"frac":0.915,"status":"ok","matched":43,"words":47},"large":{"start":76.064,"end":94.304,"frac":0.83,"status":"ok","matched":39,"words":47},"differ":true},{"i":8,"text":"Make sure to save your picture before you move on!","isAppLine":false,"small":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":10},"large":{"start":null,"end":null,"frac":0.0,"status":"unmatched","matched":0,"words":10},"differ":false}],"unassigned":{"small":[],"large":[]},"image":null}